From c5c2910801c05a8fce1a58fcb795a9fa81fcfb0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: switch2-scripts <switch2-scripts@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:54:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add ns2jb helper commands to ro:dmnt and an FS process
 handle command to HEN

RO serves the ns2jb RO helper's process commands (query, small read, FS code
map/unmap, 16-byte FS patch, FS text read toggle, bulk read as 0x524f0026)
on ro:dmnt. Writes and mappings refuse any process but FS.

HEN gains HenHomebrewCommand_GetFilesystemProcess (64), a copy of FS's
process handle that HEN keeps, so homebrew can address FS on ro:dmnt.
---
